
''' Parameter List

    State Properties
    
    'A': Speed of Sound
    'C': Mass Specific Constant Pressure Specific Heat
    'D': Density
    'H': Mass Specific Enthalpy
    'K': Thermal Conductivity
    'M': Molar Mass
    'O': Mass Specific Constant Volume Specific Heat
    'P': Pressure
    'R': Gas Constant
    'S': Mass Specific Entropy
    'T': Temperature
    'V': Viscosity (dynamic viscosity)
    'Z': Compressibility Factor

    Reaction Properties
    'X': Heat of Reaction


'''



